<P style="font-family:times;"><FONT SIZE=2><B> 4.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Significant acquisition and equity transactions (Continued) </B></FONT></P>

<P style="font-family:times;"><FONT SIZE=2><B>(c)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Acquisition of Shenzhen OneTouch Business Services&nbsp;Ltd. ("OneTouch")  </B></FONT></P>

<UL>

<P style="font-family:times;"><FONT SIZE=2>In
May&nbsp;2014, the Company completed an acquisition of the remaining interests of OneTouch. The total purchase price consisted of cash consideration of RMB790&nbsp;million and contingent
consideration with a fair value of RMB1,094&nbsp;million. Prior to this transaction, OneTouch was an equity investee which was accounted for under the equity method and was 65% owned by the Company
with a carrying amount of RMB196&nbsp;million. OneTouch is a provider of comprehensive export-related services tailored to the needs of small businesses in the PRC, including customs clearance,
logistics, cargo insurance, currency exchange, tax refund, financing and certification. </FONT></P>

<P style="font-family:times;"><FONT SIZE=2>The
allocation of the purchase price at the date of acquisition is summarized as&nbsp;follows: </FONT></P>

