<P style="font-family:times;"><FONT SIZE=2><B><BR>
ALIBABA GROUP HOLDING LIMITED<BR>
NOTES TO UNAUDITED INTERIM CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS<BR>
FOR THE SIX MONTHS ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2013 AND 2014 </B></FONT></P>

<P style="font-family:times;"><FONT SIZE=2><B> 17.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Bank borrowings (Continued) </B></FONT></P>
 <DIV style="padding:0pt;position:relative;text-align:left;margin-left:10%;">
 <UL>
<UL>


<P style="font-family:times;"><FONT SIZE=2>that
the Company is not required to maintain a minimum level of cash in a debt service reserve account. This facility will primarily be used for general corporate and working capital purposes. </FONT></P>

</UL>
</UL>
